      <rich_text>Soft Evolution

Soft eveolution
- Humans utilized ideas and concepts to push evolution inot a software type realm where basically you setup a system that is basic enough that it contains the building blocks for all things then give it the flexibility and strength to utilize those blocks dynamically.

This has allowed us to advance past our natural "hard" evolution significantly in a short time
All technology is a replacment for evolution 

Telepathy - Voice activated mobile headset - not far off

One problem with this is it also allows for deevolution at several layers both hard and soft

Evolutionary Causes or lack there of

Medicine
unnatural selection
soft evolution
	technology


Unbalanced effects of SoftEvolution


I belive the hardware software analogy can be driven very deep as both a phylisophical model and a design model



