                <rich_text>
You are warmhearted, conscientious, and cooperative. 
You want harmony in your environment, and work with determination to establish it. 
You like to work with others to complete tasks accurately and on time. 
You are loyal and follow through even in small matters. 
You notice what others need in their day-by-day lives and try to provide it. 
You want to be appreciated for who you are and for what you contribute. 

Famous people with your ESFJ personality include: Bill Clinton, Sally Field, Danny Glover, Terry Bradshaw, Mary Tyler Moore and Nancy Kerrigan




