              <node unique_id="1452" master_id="0" name="Myself" prog_lang="custom-colors" tags="" readonly="0" nosearch_me="0" nosearch_ch="0" custom_icon_id="0" is_bold="0" foreground="" ts_creation="0" ts_lastsave="0">
                <rich_text>Myself

November 30, 1980

Sagittarus

 Overtone Moon day 16
Year of the Blue Magnetic Storm

kin 206: White Spectral World-Bridger
I Dissolve in order to Equalize
Releasing Opportunity
I seal the Store of Death
With the Spectral tone of Liberation
I am guided by my own power doubled 


Jung Test Results
Introverted (I) 63.33% Extroverted (E) 36.67%
Intuitive (N) 58.54% Sensing (S) 41.46%
Thinking (T) 68.57% Feeling (F) 31.43%
Perceiving (P) 58.33% Judging (J) 41.67%

Your type is: INTP
Accuracy:

INTP - "Architect". Greatest precision in thought and language. Can readily discern contradictions and inconsistencies. The world exists primarily to be understood. 3.3% of total population.

Natal Chart
http://www.chartplanet.com/cgi-bin/build2.cgi

Numerology
 Data for: Joseph Brewer
Name at birth: Joseph Dee Brewer
Date of birth: November 30, 1980
Destiny number: 77 / 5
Life Path number: 59 / 5
Physical Plane: 7
Mental Plane: 3
Emotional Plane: 2
Intuitive Plane: 3
Personality number: 46 / 1
Soul Urge number: 31 / 4 


The influence of your Day of Birth;
You were born on the 30th day of the month, which makes your birth number 3.

Your high energy and enthusiasm will literally PROPEL you to center stage in life. Once there, you'll use your humor and persuasiveness to persuade people to see things your way and to win juicy roles in your career.

You make a wonderful manager because people look up to you and rarely contradict you. In addition, your strong intuition leads you to say the right things to the right people at the right time.

You're also a born charmer. When you were a boy, adults probably told you that you'd "be a heartbreaker" when you grew up. As a man, you use your persuasive and friendly ways to get where you need to be.

Your Destiny number;
Enthusiastic, extroverted, enticing . . .

I'll bet these words describe you perfectly! To you, life is one long non-conformist adventure. You put all your desires and goals into one thought-FREEDOM!

The reason that you're attracted to an unconventional lifestyle is that you're under the influence of a 5 Destiny. Guys with this Destiny tend to ignore the status quo and go merrily on their own adventures down the road of life. You're life isn't restricted to an armchair at home, my friend. You want to do and explore EVERYTHING.

In order to fulfill your destiny, it's important to accept that there are certain things you must be, do, and accomplish in your life. As a guy with a 5 Destiny, you are here to break up tradition and expand your personal horizons.

Your Life Path's influence;
As a traveler on the 5 Lifepath, you're always striving to be better than you were before, and better than the OTHER guy. You take advantage of the freedom this Lifepath brings you to climb that next mountain, to cross that next raging river, and to face-and CONQUER-that next obstacle!

When it comes to your life, opportunity doesn't just knock...

...it breaks the door down and brings you some wonderful options!

Your Intuitive Plane;
You are very attuned to supernatural phenomena, and have keen insight into forces which others are not even aware of.

You should learn how to tap into your excellent PSYCHIC abilities and find answers to life's mysteries.

Some people could talk until they're blue in the face and not be able to convince anyone of anything. You, on the other hand, have but to lift an eyebrow or smile ever so slightly to WIN people over. And when you actually make a formal argument for or against something, your persuasive powers are at their peak.

"Well, things could always be worse." That's a typical reaction for you to a predicament that might leave someone else in a funk for days. Being OPTIMISTIC just comes naturally to you, and you have a knack for finding the humor in almost every situation. The only thing that brings you "down" is being considered superficial or fake.

Your Personality number - how others see you;
You're quite a proud, brave and confident guy. At least, that's the impression you give to others. Even if on the inside you're a quaking bowl of Jell-O, the outside face you present is one of dynamic courage, independence and innovation!

The reason you're able to have such a FORCEFUL and DYNAMIC appearance is that you have a 1 Outer Personality. With this type of Outer Personality, you can expect to be able to take control of anything-even life-and run it efficiently and successfully. What a terrific personality to have!

Guys with the 1 Outer Personality are self-starters who just aren't cut out for a 9-to-5 job routine. If you've always hated punching that time clock, now you know why! You don't restrict yourself to a 40-hour week with this personality. Instead, you'll work as long as it takes to get the job-ANY job-done.

Your Soul Urge influence - what truly makes you happy;
Professional, proud, persevering and patient . . .

. . . these four "p" words describe you, your inner desires and your outlook perfectly!

Your down-to-earth attitude and inner strength result from the influence of a 4 Soul Urge. Any time a 4 crops up in conjunction with something as important as a Soul Urge, I know that man's going to be disciplined, loyal and honest - a guy whose constant companions are integrity and faith.

Deep down, where it counts, you're a firm believer in the work ethic and in an "honest day's work for an honest day's pay." You're not one to be caught complaining about working overtime, because accomplishments in the real world and the material gain that follows in their wake mean a lot to you.

Life Changing

Joseph, the above was just a small taste of what I can tell you. But at a time like this, you also want answers about your future. It's depressing to spend so much time not knowing if what you want to happen will happen. Worse yet, not doing what you could to make it happen.

You are a person who has many great things yet to come into their life. What I have to tell you will turn your life into the life you want - bringing you the things you deserve. What I tell you will be the most important information you will ever receive.

Keep in mind that the path to happiness is more than just monetary riches. Think about a life in which you awaken each morning to greet the day with a smile because you KNOW good things will happen to you! Picture yourself experiencing such a day in which all your spiritual and emotional traffic lights are green, allowing you to sail through the day with no roadblocks!

Imagine yourself walking into a room and automatically being the focal point of attention because your serenity has become so attractive to others. Furthermore, picture yourself being able to WEATHER DIFFICULT TIMES WITH EASE because you know that better days are just around the corner!
Life Guide

If you'd like my help in changing your life, here is what I can do.

I will tell you who you really are. You where given a name that has influenced you from birth. Numerology explains why you are this special person you are. Why you do the things you do and feel the way you feel. You'll be introduced to the real Joseph Brewer.

I will tell you the special influences that act on your life. From your purpose in life, major life cycles, money, lucky numbers, Karma, where you live, hidden passion, subconscious self and more.

I will tell you about your future. Your essence, pinnacles and challenges, personal days and months.

I will go over the next 12 months of your life in great detail so you'll know exactly what lies ahead.

I will be able to tell you about the activities and events you plan for the next 15 months by giving you access to your personal 'Life Guide.' At any time, day or night, for 15 months you can ask and receive answers to your questions about what your day will be like, what aspects will influence you and how, what days should you travel on, entertain, make a doctors appointment.




INTP (Introversion, iNtuition, Thinking, Perception)
You seek to develop logical explanations for everything that interests you. You are theoretical and abstract, and are interested more in ideas than in social interaction. You are quiet, contained, flexible, and adaptable. You have an unusual ability to focus in depth to solve problems in your area of interest. You are skeptical, sometimes critical, and always analytical. 


Famous people with your same INTP personality include: Socrates, Sir Isaac Newton, Albert Einstein, Rick Moranis, Meryl Streep, Dwight D. Eisenhower, and the Olsen Twins.



Balanced Brain

Of 30 questions, 16 of your responses indicate you are left brained dominant. 14 of your responses are indications of right brain dominance. These results indicate you have a balanced brain, with no tendency to think towards either side. Those who are middle-brain dominant tend to be more flexible than either the left or the right-brain folks; however, you often vacillate between the two hemispheres when you make decisions. You sometimes get confused when decisions need to be made because, neurologically speaking, you could do most tasks through either a left-brain or a right-brain method! A balanced score means you are able to draw on the strengths of both the right and left hemispheres of your brain depending upon a given situation. This combination makes you a creative and flexible thinker.The down side to having a more "balanced brain" is that you may sometimes feel paralyzed by indecision when the two hemispheres of your brain are competing to solve a problem in their own unique ways. You may also find career choices difficult due to your proficiency in several different areas.



</rich_text>
              </node>
