              <node unique_id="1506" master_id="0" name="Warren Buffet" prog_lang="custom-colors" tags="" readonly="0" nosearch_me="0" nosearch_ch="0" custom_icon_id="0" is_bold="0" foreground="" ts_creation="0" ts_lastsave="0">
                <rich_text>Although he's often labeled an ISTJ (Introverted, Sensing, Thinking, Judging) for his managerial prowess, Reinhold sees Buffett as a more reflective, analytically-inclined ISTP (Introverted, Sensing, Thinking, Perceiving). I see him as a craftsman who started his apprenticeship very early in life, as a hobby, and possessed some superior intellectual skills that helped him hone his craft, Reinhold says.


</rich_text>
