              <node unique_id="596" master_id="0" name="07041776 - US declares Independance" prog_lang="custom-colors" tags="" readonly="0" nosearch_me="0" nosearch_ch="0" custom_icon_id="0" is_bold="0" foreground="" ts_creation="0" ts_lastsave="0">
                <rich_text>
* July 4, 1776: In Philadelphia, Pennsylvania, the U.S. Continental Congress adopts the Declaration of Independence, which proclaims its independence from Great Britain and its king. The declaration came 442 days after the first volleys of the American Revolution were fired at Lexington and Concord in Massachusetts and marked an ideological expansion of the conflict that would eventually encourage France's intervention on behalf of the U.S. 

</rich_text>
