    * The Wright brothers invent the first gas motored and manned airplane.
    * Mary Anderson invents windshield wipers.
    * William Coolidge invents ductile tungsten used in lightbulbs.


</rich_text>
                <node unique_id="724" master_id="0" name="19031110 CE" prog_lang="custom-colors" tags="" readonly="0" nosearch_me="0" nosearch_ch="0" custom_icon_id="0" is_bold="0" foreground="" ts_creation="0" ts_lastsave="0">
