                    <rich_text>
Exactly 50 years later, on April 15, 1997, Robinson's groundbreaking career was honored and his uniform number, 42, was retired from Major League Baseball by Commissioner Bud Selig in a ceremony attended by over 50,000 fans at New York Citys Shea Stadium.  Robinson's was the first-ever number retired by all teams in the league.

