            <node unique_id="1647" master_id="0" name="20150401" prog_lang="custom-colors" tags="" readonly="0" nosearch_me="0" nosearch_ch="0" custom_icon_id="0" is_bold="0" foreground="" ts_creation="0" ts_lastsave="0"/>
            <node unique_id="1642" master_id="0" name="Journal" prog_lang="custom-colors" tags="" readonly="0" nosearch_me="0" nosearch_ch="0" custom_icon_id="0" is_bold="0" foreground="" ts_creation="0" ts_lastsave="0">
              <rich_text>


20150219
Had a really crazy dream about Pam McCallum
stephen was at my house and recieved a call which he handed to me it was pam asking me to meet her for dinner the next night
other activities persued with her in some type of hall/hotel type lobby...however she was a bruenette with glasses that didn't really look like Pam
we had a discussion about creating a company with her as CFO and how that intimate creation would pail in comparison to actually having sex

she ends up running off from me dropping all her stuff and darting through traffic 

I follow eventually dropping my stuff in order to keep up with her....i find her lying in the lap of an unknown black woman next to a chain link fence of a basketball court 
I try to get close and ask what is going on....she screams at me to leave which i do and she follows behind me eventually winding up back at my car in location of an unknown city that looked fairly run down....
we are looking for something to eat but only see a little shack serving pizza 

The whole thing was oddly real feeling 

12/18/2010:
Writing a journal is harder than I expected.  It always is though.  However things are looking bright for the potential of providing a Enterprise Application to the oil and gas leasing industry.  Looks bright from my point of view anyway in the ability to build the product.  Need customers though and Jeron is marginal at best at this point I believe.  
@ $1,000.00 per customer per month
2 customers = survival
3 customers = comfortable
4 customers = growth potential
5 customers = growth planning
10 customers = cash cow
under 2  years
This is as good a plan as any.
Goal is to have a functioning prototype by Jan 1 which is 2 weeks it is possible

12062010:
Need to let things come as they are.....I have plenty to do and need to add one objective to every task "Complete it in the moment"

12042010: seems that things are a changing I can just feel it in the phlenum...time to execute the rise.....focus attention will prescision and depth of impact
over the next couple of weeks i need to tie up several loose ends of projects and develop the core of the solutionsbrewer online community framework geared toward trinity energy as spec

11252010:  seems to me that the strong nuclear force is the diffrentiator of matter what happen if the strong nuclear force faltered
so I want to work on my writing skills in order to develop a blog and other works so I figured that a journal would be a good place to begin
Sanders shooting himself is very unexpected and troubling not that we were best friends but makes you wonder about your impact on others
I feel the need to push things along but not sure of my direction hate to be motivated by finacial matters but got to live and take care of my obligations
</rich_text>
              <node unique_id="1643" master_id="0" name="I: Future Timeline Projections" prog_lang="custom-colors" tags="" readonly="0" nosearch_me="0" nosearch_ch="0" custom_icon_id="0" is_bold="0" foreground="" ts_creation="0" ts_lastsave="0">
                <rich_text>Start a projection of various potential future timelines

try to use known measures to increase the accuracy of predictions


Enlightened
Compassion brings up back from the brink of destruction and old superstitions are shed in favor of true understanding....a New Renaissance ensues




Exterrestiral
The future moves forward as beings from other places in the universe start to make there presence absolutely known to all earth beings




Appocalyptic
A pandemic sweeps the world all modern life is up ended and chaotic times ensue

many things could send us to an appocalyptic timeline , nuclear war, astroid strike, diease, famine, climate change....i think of all these the most likely and devistating is diease as it is likely to come about from several of these sceanrios

Technological


</rich_text>
              </node>
